            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "To support the calculation of the CO2 balance for various tree crops under different cultivation scenarios, an electronic tool was developed based on the CO2 Removal Capacity Algorithm (CO2RCA). This tool (available here) translates the algorithm into an accessible, structured format, allowing users to estimate carbon removals and emissions associated with cultivation practices. The CO2 Removal Capacity Algorithm is organized into four main components\u2014CO2 Removal, CO2 Storage, CO2 Emissions, and CO2 Gain\u2014each corresponding to a distinct aspect of the carbon balance. These are described in detail below.",
